== Use ==

333 Carrer Principal operates as a mixed-use luxury complex. The lower floors contain the hotel lobby, restaurants, conference facilities, and the HRX department store. The middle floors house the Grup Pastel Primier Districte Financer, a five-star hotel with serviced apartments and guest suites. The upper floors contain the Pastel Residences, a collection of luxury condominiums with private balconies and views of the bay.

