== History ==

The tower was developed by [[Grup Pastel]] between 2003 and 2007 as part of the company's expansion into the luxury urban hotel and residential market. The project combined a flagship hotel under the company's Primier brand with private residences and a major retail anchor, reflecting Grup Pastel's vertically integrated approach to hospitality and real estate. The HRX department store was added as the retail anchor, occupying the lower floors of the north-facing podium.

